oser to her family. As Hee-sik continues to investigate a drug case, Nam-soon lends her assistance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2of1HpiXRRKjnxRoGPzwtuRCR4N.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.5","title":"Vigilante of Seoul","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-10-21T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Nam-soon assists Hee-sik in his drug investigation, she has a run-in with the ominous Ryu Si-o. Ri Hwa-ja plots her revenge against Nam-soon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kE6TC3BX88GescBvMSDna1xDKnB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.6","title":"Mystery X","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-10-22T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hee-sik witnesses the jarring effects of the drug when it strikes his team leader. Nam-soon's search for evidence garners attention from foes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8nkVN05dnTkUT1S4BC0euoCMFvH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.7","title":"Moonbow","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Geum-ju pays a strategic visit to Si-o, who has his own motives. During a birthday dinner, Nam-soon's family questions her growing kinship with Hee-sik.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xeHXWZ4cWREMqpejJwLzkt84hK3.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.8","title":"Light and Shadow of Gangnam","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2023-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hee-sik begins to worry about Nam-soon after Si-o promotes her into his inner circle. Geum-ju probes deeper into a suspicious businessman.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qZeacevs4D81bqcQ23hoq7gUN1x.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.9","title":"The Root of Vice","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2023-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Nam-soon pulls off a bold heist, putting Si-o on high alert. During a tense meeting, Geum-ju challenges Si-o — who in return begins plotting his revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s1hF41VvMuvkCSHTFKjuHfSLbBI.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.10","title":"The Stand-ins","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2023-11-05T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Geum-ju falls victim to Si-o's attack but proves she's one step ahead of him. As Nam-soon finally tracks down the drugs, her brother succumbs to them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1BIWc3t9WzAJ0p6O9YcCHrxq2OB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.11","title":"Breaking Point","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2023-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The drug infiltrates Nam-soon's family — prompting a search of the source and an antidote. A mourning Hee-sik furiously goes after Si-o's inner circle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yO5ccuaWtv390IZHl2bDGcdHUtb.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.12","title":"Diamond Cuts Diamond","season":1,"episode":12,"released":"2023-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Si-o learns of Geum-ju's ruse and decides to expand his target. As the drug case becomes more intense, Hee-sik asks Nam-soon to move in with him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/knQypxG43Zp1wGg94NNR7ahHnFX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.13","title":"Save the Sea Hares","season":1,"episode":13,"released":"2023-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"To find out Nam-soon's identity, Si-o narrows down his search and goes after her family. Hee-sik faces harsh discipline after news of the drug goes wide.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/glOc8OBlR78b4ZF3Ozdj9TO3w1V.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.14","title":"Forewarned Bloodbath","season":1,"episode":14,"released":"2023-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Si-o vows revenge after discovering the truth about Nam-soon. While Hee-sik continues his investigation, Nam-soon and her family go on a trip to Busan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/LRNrhXboGA2q4ZS7FNKRiZSL6n.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.15","title":"Strong Girl Nam-soon","season":1,"episode":15,"released":"2023-11-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mourning the loss of Hwa-ja, Nam-soon directly challenges Si-o. But he refuses to lose, forcing her to endure incredible pain to save her adopted mother.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9t8XVXywIFyBUZfA8ClbpXDljmB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjMvU3Ryb25nLUdpcmwtTmFtLXNvb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMjMlMjkv.1.16","title":"In the Name of Love and Justice","season":1,"episode":16,"released":"2023-11-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Nam-soon on the brink of death — Hee-sik rushes to find an antidote. Nam-soon faces Si-o once again but witnesses a surprising turn.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AlOLmfyO4QS6KUqwlIwSwvb0hbf.jpg"}]}}